From: u3bd94f65c4684bac at groups.google.com (Shane)
Date: Wed, 14 May 2008 22:49:12 +0000
Subject: Re: Just want to understand
Message-ID: <reWzMS1ILug.zHSi0bR_wRkJ@rattle-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <reWzMS1ILug.r1ZeTNBghZoJ@rattle-users.groups.google.com>
References: <reWzMS1ILug.xDqW_I9w9N0J@rattle-users.groups.google.com> <reWzMS1ILug.r1ZeTNBghZoJ@rattle-users.groups.google.com>
